{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15907","headline":"泛水曲 · 王建","name":"泛水曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"载酒入烟浦，方舟泛绿波。\n子酌我复饮，子饮我还歌。\n莲深微路通，峰曲幽气多。\n阅芳无留瞬，弄桂不停柯。\n水上秋日鲜，西山碧峩峩。\n兹欢良可贵，谁复更来过。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15907.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15907","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}